    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitanapa Enkai Abraham meishoo Isaak metaa olasar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.17+HEB.11.18+HEB.11.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 11.17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore etulusoitie kuna baa etetema Enkai Abraham ejoki ninye, “Abraham” nejo ninye, “Nele nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 3.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki, “Toriko olayioni lino Isaak ilo laa ninye ake iata, ilo linyor, nipuopuo enkop e Moria, nintayu ninye te ine metaa olasar o pejori te nchumata o ldoinyo obo laaliki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa einyo Abraham tadekenya enasirie neirot osikiria lenye, nerik ilbarnot lenyena oare tenebo enkayioni enye Isaak. Nedung'u ilkeek ooinokie olasar opejori, nedumunye alo ewueji netiaka ninye Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e uni, neraposhu Abraham inkonyek nedol ewueji nelakua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Abraham ilbarnot lenyena, “Entotoni tene tenebo ele sikiria pee alo nanu o enkayioni idie aaseremisho peyie kintoki aashukunye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya Abraham ilkeek ooinokieki olasar opejori, neiteleiki oloililai le Isaak enkayioni enye. Nenap te nkaina enye enkima o enkalem. Nepuo pokira are aairiamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Isaak papaai lenye Abraham, “Papaai!” Nejo Abraham “Nele nanu enkayioni ai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Isaak, “Ing'ura ajo kiata enkima o lkeek paa koree doi olkuo le ker likintainye olasar opejori?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Abraham, “Ekeisho Enkai kewan olkuo le ker lolasar o pejori enkayioni ai.” Kaae nepuo pokira are aairiamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yko 2.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore peyie ebau ewueji natuutaka Enkai ninye, neshetu Abraham olperere lo lasar te ine neirragie ilkeek aitobiraki, neen Isaak enkayioni enye, neirragie ninye te wueji o lasar te nchumata oo lkeek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitorioo Abraham enkaina enye nedumu enkalem nayieng'ie enkayioni enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eipoto ninye olmalaika lo Laitoriani eing'uaa keper ejoki, “Abraham! Abraham!” Nejo ninye, “Nele nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo, olmalaika, “Minteleiki enkaina ino enkayioni anaa intaas ninye ae, amu atayiolo taata ajo iure Enkai amu atoduaa ajo eitu kimitiki enkayioni ino ina naa ninye ake iata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neraposhu Abraham inkonyek enyena aing'orisho nedol te siadi ninye olmeregesh otaasha entim imowuarak enyena, nelo Abraham aya ilo meregesh, neitayu ninye aitaa olasar opejori te rishata e nkayioni enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipot Abraham ine wueji ajo, “Eneishorunye Olaitoriani.” Naa ina arna eeta ine o taata, ore to ldoinyo lo Laitoriani keishoruni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olmalaika lo Laitoriani aipot Abraham enkata e are eing'uaa shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.6.13+HEB.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 6.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo, “Ainosa nanu olmumai te nkewan ai ejo Olaitoriani, ore amu itaasa ena neitu imit enkayioni ino aa ninye ake iata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 11.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ekaamayian iyie oleng', naa kaponaa eishoi ino metotiwuo anaa ilakir le keper netiu sii anaa osinyai le nkiyopata enaiposha. Ore eishoi ino neaku e nenye kishomi oo lmang'ati lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.3.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 3.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa tiatua eishoi ino emayian iloshon le nkop pooki ate, amu itoning'o oltoilo lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerrinyokino Abraham ilbarnot lenyena, nedumunye pooki aapuo Beer-sheba. Nebik Abraham te Beer-sheba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Nahor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore ti oriong kuna baa, etiakaki Abraham, “Ing'ura sii ajo, etoikio Milka olalashe lino Nahor inkera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usi ilo kikau lenye, o Obus olalashe lenye, o Kemuel menye le Aram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keseed, o Haso, o Pildash, o Yidlaf o Betuel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku Betuel menye le Rebeka. Lelo pokira isiet etoikio Milka olalashe le Abraham Nahor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
